{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:34:03.853Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d8e81a0cf6c9f5c5a9542b06992af7a6d02fee253df86bc92c3622f00a3d14eb","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, I could confirm two of the three. I couldn't find who took over Saltmarsh.\n\n- **Discount:** 10%. On 17 Nov 2025 Bettina first posted 12%. Ten minutes later she corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread June's draft worksheet. Bettina's correction is the only source I have for this. The figure was posted in this channel, so I can repeat it here.\n- **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827. Kwame opened it in this channel on 15 Oct 2025. Corinne's admin option was missing, and she could still sign in. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is the door 3 to door 4 exception-report ticket.\n- **Who took over Saltmarsh, and when:** I can't confirm this. Moss's Coastal notes and the channel history don't record a Saltmarsh handover. The ownership change they do record is Pellucid Harbor Logistics, which passed to Kwame (officially 3 Nov 2025, fully by 22 Nov). That is a different account. The cheat sheet still lists Saltmarsh as \"Sofia's grocery account\", and a May 2026 note has Bettina handling the Saltmarsh follow-up while you were out. Neither says the account was reassigned. Please check with Bettina before putting a name in the handover file."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
